{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）上午9時11分，警方接獲報案，指葵涌道往九龍方向、任合興工業大廈對開，有3車相撞，涉及一輛輕型貨車、一輛中型貨車及一輛小巴。意外中，有3男6女受輕傷，其中包括一名孕婦。救援人員接報到場為傷者治理，警方正調查意外成因。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，葵涌道（往九龍方向）近昌榮路迴旋處的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191692069161275392936724.png/hTpJdRnT7_tjGw2jCYpK_2EeLVoTXT--P6yGxT-shsU\"/><figcaption>綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有大批警車戒備。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191692066602618880823704.png/rYrweVWqeZwk1oc4gB99dPsVUMdwvDiWANjvNwDY7zc\"/><figcaption>現場有大批警車戒備。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。（Google Map路況圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191691742420668416032168.png/lN5qq_5AYLn0GCFjMLAwv_TtTIHBg6DOuTTx47k08eM\"/><figcaption>現場交通擠塞。（Google Map路況圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:14:00.205237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:08:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:43.146795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:43.146795+00:00","content_hash":"05f083e4d5965258797e2bce7325003fadf53dc6474363039b24f5b4000fec36","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}